#x02013; %). N = 30</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Characteristics</bold></th><th valign="middle" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><bold>Baseline</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean age (SD)</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">67.2 (7.6)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of females (%)</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14 (43.8)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean distance (km) home &#x02013; hospital (SD)</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">19 (16)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Number of smokers (%)</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2 (6.7)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean number of year smoked (SD)</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">26 (17)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" colspan="2" rowspan="1">Education level (%)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013; Compulsory school</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16 (53.3)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013; Middle level</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 (26.7)</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013; University</td><td valign="top" align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 (20.0)</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-copd-2-617" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Mean for the self-management group (SMG) at baseline and after 6, 12 and 24 months (standard error &#x02013; SE)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><bold>Variable <x